;; use 217 distinct archives; 225 paths form the CLI/SDK runtime closure.
;; Node resolution preserves workspace-local and nested dependency versions.
;; Dependencies, optional dependencies, and present peers are retained.
;; Only the proprietary @github/copilot packages and @koromix/koffi platform
;; prebuilds are excluded from the runtime graph.  Koffi and node-pty are built
;; from source by the consuming package, without npm lifecycle execution.
;; Build-only additions are TypeScript 6.0.3 and the SDK's SQL.js/WS types.
;; Unrelated documentation, lint, test, and browser tool graphs are omitted.
;;
;; The lock has 644 external entries (646 node_modules rows including two
;; workspace links), of which 225 omit both resolved and integrity.  Exact npm
;; version metadata supplies 129 retained missing origins.  Every tarball was
;; fetched and verified against npm metadata SHA-512; the 100 retained lock
;; entries with integrity were also verified.  SHA-256 below hashes real bytes
;; with guix hash, rather than translating an integrity field.
;;
;; Archive manifests match the lock's dependency declarations and all stated
;; licenses.  The 229 paths comprise 165 MIT, 35 Apache-2.0, 14 ISC, 12
;; BSD-3-Clause, one BSD-2-Clause, one MIT OR CC0-1.0, and qrcode-terminal,
;; whose included LICENSE establishes Apache-2.0 plus bundled MIT QRCode code
;; although its manifest/lock omit license metadata.  All published notices
;; are retained; the two upstream-omitted MIT notices are fixed separately below.

